  all 48,000 production rows the next time deploy runs. SQLite's [38;5;153mALTER TABLE ... DROP COLUMN[39m has no rollback — once
  applied, that data is gone unless it exists in a backup. "We stopped using it" tells me nothing is [3mreading[0m the column;
  it doesn't tell me the stored contents are expendable.
